  ["Final [Cascadable|Echo] of [Cascadable|Cascadable] [Spell|Spells] also [Cascadable|Cascades] to either side of the targeted Area along a random axis"] = "Final Echo of Cascadable Spells also Cascades to either side of the targeted Area along a random axis",
